   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"\\left( {{x^2} - 4x + 8} \\right) - \\left( {{x^2} + 5x + 12} \\right)\"></span></p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"{x^2} - 4x + 8 - {x^2} - 5x - 12\"></span></td>\n<td>Distribute the subtraction.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n</tr></tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Like terms are constants or have the same variable and exponent. Group the like terms.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\left( {{x^2} - {x^2}} \\right) + \\left( { - 4x - 5x} \\right) + \\left( {8 - 12} \\right)\"></span></p>\n<p>Add the coefficients and keep the same variable.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\" - 9x - 4\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\" - 9x – 4\"> - 9x – 4</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
